# Typed literals that name an impossible or doubled wall clock are refused.
2026-03-08T02:30
2026-11-01T01:30
# Reaching one by arithmetic is not the user's mistake, so it resolves with a note.
2026-03-07T02:30 + 1d
2026-10-31T01:30 + 1d
# A calendar day keeps the wall clock; exact hours keep the elapsed time.
2026-11-01T00:30 + 1d
2026-11-01T00:30 + 24h
# Truncating to a calendar day lands on midnight even on a 25-hour day.
trunc(2026-11-01T23:30, 1d)
trunc(2026-11-01T23:30, 24h)
